# AI in the Real World

## 📝 To Do 

#### AI systems use data to make decisions in real-world applications. 
#### Let’s explore how different AI models function and what data they rely on.

>#### Choose one of the scenarios below and consider:
>- #### What is the AI model doing in this scenario?
>- #### What type of data is being input?
>- #### What does this AI system do with the data?
>- #### Why does this task require speed and scale?

